@startuml US006_SSD
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant System

User -> System : Requests to create a recipe
System --> User : Asks for a recipe name and number of servings
User -> System : Provides the name and number of servings

loop For each ingredient
    User -> System : Searches for a food
    System --> User : Displays matching foods
    User -> System : Selects a food and specifies its quantity
    System --> User : Displays the ingredient added to the recipe
end

User -> System : Confirms the recipe
System --> User : Confirms the saved recipe and displays calories and macros

User -> System : Requests saved recipes
System --> User : Displays saved recipes
User -> System : Selects a recipe, meal, and number of servings to log
System --> User : Confirms the logged recipe and displays updated daily nutrition

@enduml
